        "mutationTarget": "/machineVerification/verifierIdentity/digest",
        "predicateObservationRoute": "replacing only the nested digest without also successfully rebinding every dependent recomputed value causes either the nested/top-level digest-consistency check or the full receiptDigest recomputation-mismatch check to fail closed",
